          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "更优。如果此后的摸牌极为顺利：\n"
          },
          {
            "type": "figure",
            "figureId": "nemata-jp-p258-r28",
            "text": "23455m 23344p 236s；自摸2p"
          },
          {
